  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.4.33 (forks 2.4.32) - FIX (CUDA, OpenCL, WebGPU, WebGL, Wasm; silent wrong results): a conversion into bf16, FP8 E4M3 / E5M2 or FP4 E2M1 rounds to the type (was the identity: (float)(BFloat16)x returned x). FIX (same backends; silent wrong results): Half / bf16 / FP8 / FP4 arithmetic results round to the type as the .NET operators do (were float-exact until a store; up to 4,085 of 4,096 Half products differed). FIX (WebGPU): emulated-f16 float -> Half rounds; native f16 division matches .NET. FIX (WebGL): FP8 / FP4 decoders keep -0. OpenCL: a kernel that fails to compile carries the build log in CLException. New tests on every backend: LowPrecisionRoundTrip_*, LowPrecisionArithmetic_*. See CHANGELOG.md.",
